{
  "server": "cn",
  "storyId": "act15d5_level_act15d5_st01",
  "groupId": "act15d5",
  "stageId": null,
  "title": "无续集",
  "storyCode": "",
  "avgTag": "幕间",
  "sourcePath": "../../vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act15d5/level_act15d5_st01.txt",
  "sourceHash": "6f340a14117aa2d6a240734c1818c1c6c6c1aaebaa0cafb365ec82af20b26c48",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_lungmen_o"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（哈欠）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "被褥叠成豆腐干，这样就成了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "钱包，钥匙，外套......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "通讯设备，不带了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "盾......也算了，老伙计，今天你就休息一下。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "鞋就穿这双吧，嗯，不对，不好，要不然还是穿这双限定版的？啊，这双感觉也不错，和今天的衣服挺搭。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唉，不然还是换回这双吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "诗怀雅",
      "speakerId": "char_308_swire",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（白眼）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Missy，正好，你觉得哪双最顺眼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "诗怀雅",
      "speakerId": "char_308_swire",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "别问我，我现在看你哪儿都不顺眼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "怎么了，你今天脾气不太好。特殊日子？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "诗怀雅",
      "speakerId": "char_308_swire",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我好你*龙门粗口*！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "诗怀雅",
      "speakerId": "char_308_swire",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "一大早敲我门到底干嘛？！就为了看你数鞋？你收藏了这么多鞋我都看不出有什么大区别！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那怎么能一样，版型和材质都差远了......哎，我和你说这些干什么。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "看在咱们宿舍挨着，算邻居的份上，互帮互助嘛。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "诗怀雅",
      "speakerId": "char_308_swire",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我管你啊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "诗怀雅",
      "speakerId": "char_308_swire",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "搞清楚，今天可是休息日！现在还差三分钟到六点，我只要按下这个报警器，立刻就能告你扰民！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "诗怀雅",
      "speakerId": "char_308_swire",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你想加班就自己去，整天这么工作迟早脱发谢顶，少拖上我一起！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "加班就算了吧，难得的休假，近卫局加班费发得又不多，还挺抠门的。我又不是老陈那个工作狂。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "而且Missy，这一点上你也不好说我吧？你是不是才刚从近卫局回来，我听见你开门又摔门的声音了，真够响的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "诗怀雅",
      "speakerId": "char_308_swire",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啰嗦！我烦得很！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "诗怀雅",
      "speakerId": "char_308_swire",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "最近事情那么多，又有整合运动留下的烂摊子，还有那只臭老鼠那边的事......那个扑街龙关键时候又不在，哪一件不要处理？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "诗怀雅",
      "speakerId": "char_308_swire",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你升个职，他们还想着要把你调走，调到哪去？特别督查组难道就交给别人？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "诗怀雅",
      "speakerId": "char_308_swire",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "真是气死我了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "别气，别气。魏先生不是没考虑，这是要练你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "将来近卫局还要靠你撑着，要我说，迟早的事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你可以的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "诗怀雅",
      "speakerId": "char_308_swire",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......你......你又说这样的话，这些我当然知道！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "诗怀雅",
      "speakerId": "char_308_swire",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可、可担着近卫局的本来可以是......本来应该是......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "诗怀雅",
      "speakerId": "char_308_swire",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唉，你可别又哭了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "诗怀雅",
      "speakerId": "char_308_swire",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "谁哭了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "诗怀雅",
      "speakerId": "char_308_swire",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "等着瞧，那条臭龙不回来拉倒，迟早有一天我会拿下近卫局。都给我等着瞧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哈哈，那还真是令人期待。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "诗怀雅",
      "speakerId": "char_308_swire",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唉，不对，等等，你刚刚说，听到我回来时候开门的声音了？所以你是知道我一晚上没睡？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "诗怀雅",
      "speakerId": "char_308_swire",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那你还来叫我干嘛，还说自己不是故意的？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哎，哎，别激动。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这不是怕你把自己逼得太紧。最近事太多，咱们也有挺久没碰面了吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "喏，是不是又没吃早饭？我买了早茶，你喜欢的炒粉，吃一点再去睡吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "诗怀雅",
      "speakerId": "char_308_swire",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哼，多管闲事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好，好，就算我多管闲事。你还吃吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "诗怀雅",
      "speakerId": "char_308_swire",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "当然吃！拿来！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "诗怀雅",
      "speakerId": "char_308_swire",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "咦，你怎么还买两份？这么多，怎么吃得完。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊......是两份？可能是习惯了，顺手就买了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "诗怀雅",
      "speakerId": "char_308_swire",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "诗怀雅",
      "speakerId": "char_308_swire",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "三菌禽肉丝，沙鲜酱，多加了粉根。......哼，也就那家伙才喜欢这个味儿。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "诗怀雅",
      "speakerId": "char_308_swire",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这家粉选得不怎么样，味太淡，料不足，勉勉强强吧。下次记得要近卫局楼下转角第二家，外面挂了个蓝色招牌的，那家更好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "行了，知道了，下回再给你带。先凑合吃点，唉，别急，慢点吃。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "诗怀雅",
      "speakerId": "char_308_swire",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（哈欠）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "诗怀雅",
      "speakerId": "char_308_swire",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "对了，你今天要去哪？反正我都醒了，要逛街可以算我一个。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "诗怀雅",
      "speakerId": "char_308_swire",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我要去把舒尔洛夫斯基的那条首饰给买下来，新品，JOKER系列，上个礼拜刚出的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哦，就是老陈早就看中的那条？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "诗怀雅",
      "speakerId": "char_308_swire",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "没错，就是那个，这方面她眼光倒是还行，对衣服首饰比我会挑。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "难得你夸她。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "要我说，这种首饰每次买回来也戴不了几回，好在她工资够高，还有近卫局的免费宿舍住，要不然可够呛。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不过，Missy，你约我？真难得，这是不是头一次？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "诗怀雅",
      "speakerId": "char_308_swire",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "要不是没其他人选，你当我想约你？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我想也是。哎，说正经的，再不出门就要迟了，我得先走了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "诗怀雅",
      "speakerId": "char_308_swire",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哎，你去哪？等我下，我去化个妆！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "别，你不化妆也挺好的，“小姐”。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "多谢你约我，不过今天还是算了，我就出去兜兜风，没什么好跟着的。下次再载你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "去睡吧，黑眼圈留太久的话，之后想消掉可不那么容易。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你真的该多休息休息了，诗怀雅。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_indoor_3"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "近卫局成员",
      "speakerId": "char_015_lmg",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "长官，早上好！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "早。你们辛苦了。吃早茶吗，被推荐了一家店，我就顺路带了点过来。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "真是，休假日早上这个点，怎么还能在这栋楼里见到这么多人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "近卫局成员",
      "speakerId": "char_015_lmg",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那次事件之后，最近一直都这样，唉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "疲惫的近卫局成员",
      "speakerId": "char_015_lmg",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "星熊长官不也是，才离开没几个小时就又回来了，我记得您今天休假吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哪能这么比，我不一样。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "比起这个，你真的还好？我怎么觉得你在晃......吃点东西，先去休息室躺一会吧，别喝那么多提神饮料，对身体不好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "疲惫的近卫局成员",
      "speakerId": "char_015_lmg",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊，谢谢长官。不过没事，忙完手头这些活我就能回家睡觉了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "疲惫的近卫局成员",
      "speakerId": "char_015_lmg",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（哈欠）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "行，那我也不多说，你自己调节。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这段时间大家都辛苦了。过了这阵子，请你们吃大餐。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "疲惫的近卫局成员",
      "speakerId": "char_015_lmg",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "大餐就算了，我更想加薪。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "疲惫的近卫局成员",
      "speakerId": "char_015_lmg",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "前两天还碰到那个罗德岛办事处的，那家伙还和我炫耀他又晋升了......嗤，有什么好炫耀的，不就是假期比我多点......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "近卫局成员",
      "speakerId": "char_015_lmg",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......罗德岛？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "近卫局成员",
      "speakerId": "char_015_lmg",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "就是之前，和我们合作的那个，而且还带走了陈长官的那个？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "近卫局成员",
      "speakerId": "char_015_lmg",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那些人不是早就跑了吗！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊......说的是本地的那个办事处吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我记得他们还负责招人，之前是不是还有几个街头的小子跑去闹了一场，结果反给人劝去打工了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他们口才真没的说。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你也别老是去找人家麻烦，他们办事处那儿留的都是咱们龙门的市民，挑不出错的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "回头和下头的小子们也都说一声，别犯浑。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "疲惫的近卫局成员",
      "speakerId": "char_015_lmg",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哪能呢。大家心里清楚。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "疲惫的近卫局成员",
      "speakerId": "char_015_lmg",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我们和罗德岛那儿的，关系还行，偶尔还在一起喝一杯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "疲惫的近卫局成员",
      "speakerId": "char_015_lmg",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他们那怪人多，除了本地几个职员，偶尔还能碰上外边路过的。有些看起来就不简单，我们也就忍不住多盯着点。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "疲惫的近卫局成员",
      "speakerId": "char_015_lmg",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "上周还有个拉特兰啥修道会的姑娘也一起......别说，那些人喝起来还挺有量。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "近卫局成员",
      "speakerId": "char_015_lmg",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊？！大哥你之前喝得烂醉回来，原来是和罗德岛的人喝酒喝成那样？！你还吐了我一身！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "疲惫的近卫局成员",
      "speakerId": "char_015_lmg",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊......有这回事？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "近卫局成员",
      "speakerId": "char_015_lmg",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "当然有！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "疲惫的近卫局成员",
      "speakerId": "char_015_lmg",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "行，行，是我不好。那你下次请假去和小女朋友逛街我给你批了，行了吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "疲惫的近卫局成员",
      "speakerId": "char_015_lmg",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "再等等，等这阵子忙完，该重建的城区把重建日程都提上去，就好了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "近卫局成员",
      "speakerId": "char_015_lmg",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这我当然知道......说真的，等这阵子过去，估计我也没女朋友了......唉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "疲惫的近卫局成员",
      "speakerId": "char_015_lmg",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嘿那不错。不用批假了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嘴够欠。快少说两句吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "近卫局成员",
      "speakerId": "char_015_lmg",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他就这样，我都习惯了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "疲惫的近卫局成员",
      "speakerId": "char_015_lmg",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "臭小子。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "疲惫的近卫局成员",
      "speakerId": "char_015_lmg",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "长官也是，今天难得能有假，别在这耽搁了，赶紧回去休息吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "近卫局成员",
      "speakerId": "char_015_lmg",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是啊，这里就交给我们吧！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哟，看来我不怎么受欢迎，要不然你们怎么老想着赶我走？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "近卫局成员",
      "speakerId": "char_015_lmg",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不、不是，我不是这个意思......！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哈哈，行了，别紧张，开玩笑的。我就是过来看看，顺便给你们送点吃的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "拿好，炒粉。那你们忙，我先走了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_uptown_1"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唉，累了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这才通宵几天，就有点吃不住，怪难受的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "该不会是上年纪了？不应该啊，我也还勉强能算年轻吧......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "算是吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哈，算了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗨，伙计，你怎么想？好久没让你出来活动活动了，今天我们去外岗那条赛道好好来一场，透透风。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哎，你今天风口声音有点不对劲，难道你也上了年纪？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不，不至于，你明明还是新款。70vv。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "虽然确实是刚出了个比你更新的款。沉稳无颠簸，风驰电掣的感觉，他们广告一向做得挺不错的是不。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我还挺想搞来一台试试，不过贵得很。放心吧伙计，我们互相将就一下，我工资没那么高，不能总是这么花钱。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你离过时还远着，我离退休也还早，我们是挺般配的吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你说，老陈这人怎么就这么倔？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "她在罗德岛能习惯不？会不会和人打起来？我猜会。她不是不能和人搞好关系，就怕她不乐意......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "非也。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——什么人！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白雪",
      "speakerId": "char_118_yuki",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "陈小姐并非陈腐顽固之人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白雪",
      "speakerId": "char_118_yuki",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "非一味倔强。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊，我当是谁。您是......白雪阁下。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白雪",
      "speakerId": "char_118_yuki",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（点头）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白雪",
      "speakerId": "char_118_yuki",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "星熊长官。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不必这么客气，白雪阁下怎么在这？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白雪",
      "speakerId": "char_118_yuki",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "夫人，暂离。命我守此。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "原来如此。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "听说白雪阁下前段时间被夫人指派去了罗德岛？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "怎么样，阿米娅小妹妹还好吗？还有她身边的博士......我还记得那人当时贴在遮蔽物上指挥，怪聪明也怪狼狈的。他们现在都如何了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白雪",
      "speakerId": "char_118_yuki",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "精力充沛，意气高昂。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白雪",
      "speakerId": "char_118_yuki",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "叽哩哇啦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白雪",
      "speakerId": "char_118_yuki",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "吵人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哈哈哈哈，还是那么有精神。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "看起来白雪阁下也对罗德岛印象挺好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白雪",
      "speakerId": "char_118_yuki",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "罗德岛确实不错。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白雪",
      "speakerId": "char_118_yuki",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "陈小姐也是。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白雪",
      "speakerId": "char_118_yuki",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......不必多忧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "怎么，连白雪阁下也说这样的话......难道我看上去就是满脸忧愁过度的样子？真的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不对啊，我要真是这样，Missy今早就该把我脸皮都抓下来一层。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白雪",
      "speakerId": "char_118_yuki",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "放心吧，白雪阁下。我真没那么担心老陈。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "真的。你别看老陈这人看起来直，有点刚极易折的意思，其实她心思细着呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我最开始认识她的时候也没料到，之后相处多了才明白。我信只要她别钻牛角尖，不管在哪儿都能活得像样。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白雪",
      "speakerId": "char_118_yuki",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "陈小姐聪颖伶俐。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白雪",
      "speakerId": "char_118_yuki",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "口齿犀利，动手亦不逊色。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白雪",
      "speakerId": "char_118_yuki",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "等闲欺不到她。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哈哈，没错。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你说，哪有她那样的？惹了她就变着法子骂人，只要占理就谁都敢骂，没见她怕过。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白雪",
      "speakerId": "char_118_yuki",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "陈小姐......率直。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "老陈这脾气，这些年其实是一直都没怎么变过。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我总觉得她这人身上侠气重，要是那些侠客漫画，这样的人就该做主角。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不过呢，有血有肉的故事好看，那些伤落在自己身上，也是真的疼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我有时看着她疼得不行，就想，真值得这样？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不值得。说真的，一切说开了，我就觉得真不值得。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可她觉得值。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我不担心她吃亏，吃点亏不是坏事，太要强会吃大苦头的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "就怕她看不开，放不下。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白雪",
      "speakerId": "char_118_yuki",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白雪",
      "speakerId": "char_118_yuki",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "陈小姐胸怀宽阔。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白雪",
      "speakerId": "char_118_yuki",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "如今心结已除，更不可挡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "白雪阁下看得清楚。魏大人和夫人更看得明白。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白雪",
      "speakerId": "char_118_yuki",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "星熊长官，亦是侠客。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我？不了，这就夸过头了，自己的事自己清楚。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "年轻时候不懂事儿，当然也做过梦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "冲动的事干过不少，也不是没那腔热血。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可热血故事结束，少年不再是少年，又怎么办？故事里也不会写这样的事儿，写了还得被读者骂，白费力气，不如不写。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "故事能在最好的时候有个结局，可生活不会。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "侠客要是像我这样，带了柴米油盐烟火气，就不讨人喜欢了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白雪",
      "speakerId": "char_118_yuki",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不可妄自菲薄。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白雪",
      "speakerId": "char_118_yuki",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白雪",
      "speakerId": "char_118_yuki",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "请看此物。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这是......漫画？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白雪",
      "speakerId": "char_118_yuki",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "太金道，第二个巷口的书店。本月新书。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白雪",
      "speakerId": "char_118_yuki",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "赠与阁下。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......真稀奇。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "多谢了。不过白雪阁下怎么也读这个？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白雪",
      "speakerId": "char_118_yuki",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "长官一读便知。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白雪",
      "speakerId": "char_118_yuki",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那么。白雪告辞。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（这书......）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（新人漫画家出道作，读者支持度总榜第二，业内漫画家倾情推荐......）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（看起来好像还不错。封面这个是主人公？）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（怎么感觉有点，眼熟......）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（......）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（这个拿盾的大个子是......）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊，哈。原来是这么回事。怪不得。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "胆子不小。不过还算有分寸，画得还不错。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "算了。算啦......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "以后再见到老陈，得叫什么？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "陈干员？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唔......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "挺好，还挺合适。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_lungmenbridge"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（速度还不够。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（前面是......弯道。正好，还能再提一挡。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "独角的鬼舒出一口气。\n她很久没像这样在过于苛烈的风中疾驰，身下的爱车每每发出吼叫，年少时的狂妄血液似乎也总在这样不为达到终点的飞驰中复苏。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "——直到身后陡然响起另一头机械野兽的嘶鸣。\n龙门近卫局的星熊长官回过神来。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（是谁......？）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（声音从后面来，在接近。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "能追得上我，速度不错。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嚯，这线型和引擎声，是广告上最新那款，八成还改装过。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "加把油伙计，我们也不能输。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（怪事，什么时候出了这么个厉害人物，我却还不知道？）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（怎么那么像是那个......）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（“在无人的深夜街道疾驰，闪现在弯道上的幽灵车手”。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（等等，但是车对不上。而且，那个幽灵车手的身份可是......）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......不会吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_lungmenbridge"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......呼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "厉害。是我输了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "文月",
      "speakerId": "char_2006_weiywfmzuki",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "承让。刚刚那个弯道过得很好，如果不是车好些，我还超不过来。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "文月",
      "speakerId": "char_2006_weiywfmzuki",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "上午好，星熊督察。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "比不上文月夫人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "文月",
      "speakerId": "char_2006_weiywfmzuki",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哎呀，你好像并不惊讶。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "其实还挺惊讶的，刚刚速度太快，过了那个弯道，才敢猜是您。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "夫人原本的车大伙都眼熟，不会认错，今天这辆车还是头一次见。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "文月",
      "speakerId": "char_2006_weiywfmzuki",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那你现在要给我开罚单吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哪能呢。这段赛道本身就对外封锁，专门供赛车用......如果这都要开罚单的话，我自己也跑不掉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "文月",
      "speakerId": "char_2006_weiywfmzuki",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呵呵，平常都辛苦各位了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "应该的，不辛苦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "文月",
      "speakerId": "char_2006_weiywfmzuki",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "怎么了，星熊督察，你看上去似乎还有话要说？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哎......也没什么。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "就是觉得，这里的风吹起来真舒服。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "将油门一脚踩到底，的确会让人心情变好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "文月",
      "speakerId": "char_2006_weiywfmzuki",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "没错，就是说啊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "文月",
      "speakerId": "char_2006_weiywfmzuki",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "事情太多忙不过来的时候，能吹吹风，真的可以让人好受不少。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "文月",
      "speakerId": "char_2006_weiywfmzuki",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不过，你想说的不止这些吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唔......果然瞒不过夫人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我只是在想——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "魏大人这两天停在楼下的，那辆完全不符合他兴趣的奢华版水箭35炫彩机车，果然不是他自己的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
